---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Feature from '../components/Feature.astro';
import Partners from '../components/Partners.astro';
import Cta from '../components/Cta.astro';
import { img } from '../lib/images';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const licences = [
  {
    file: 'license-incorporation-tanzania.jpg',
    alt: 'Certificate of incorporation, Tanzania',
    caption: 'Certificate of Incorporation, Tanzania',
  },
  {
    file: 'license-registration-1.jpg',
    alt: 'Company registration, Rwanda Development Board',
    caption: 'Company registration, Rwanda',
  },
  {
    file: 'license-registration-2.jpg',
    alt: 'Business activities registration, Rwanda Development Board',
    caption: 'Business activities, Rwanda',
  },
  {
    file: 'license-uma-certificate.jpg',
    alt: 'Uganda Manufacturers Association membership certificate',
    caption: 'Uganda Manufacturers Association member',
  },
];
---

<Base
  title="About Us"
  description="Learn about PETIC GLOBAL: our history across the Gulf States, Tanzania, Rwanda and Uganda, our mission, licences and partners."
>
  <PageHero
    crumb="About us"
    title="About PETIC GLOBAL."
    lead="A group established across the Middle East and Africa, providing quality construction projects and engineering services in the sector of oil &amp; gas, infrastructure, manufacturing and agriculture."
    image="oil-gas-plant-3.jpg"
    alt="Oil and gas facility at dusk"
    chip={{ title: '77+ projects', sub: 'Private and public sectors worldwide' }}
    tags={['Construction', 'Infrastructure', 'Manufacturing', 'Agriculture', 'Oil & gas']}
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Who we are</span>
        <h2>Established worldwide, rooted in the Gulf and Africa.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Sheik Salah has been in worldwide business, establishing various companies in the Middle East and
          Africa, providing quality construction projects and engineering services in the sector of oil &amp;
          gas.
        </p>
        <p>
          At the beginning, the Petic group invested heavily in the Gulf States and Tanzania by building
          infrastructure and road projects. In its next phase the group moved into manufacturing household and
          pharmaceutical products in Rwanda, and gas cylinders in Uganda.
        </p>
        <p>
          The group is now planning to represent Chinese car manufacturers by creating an assembling workshop
          in Africa.
        </p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn--navy" href={site.profile} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <Icon name="download" />
            Company profile
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/contact/">
            Contact us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="split__media reveal" data-delay="1">
        <Image
          src={img('oil-pipes-yard.jpg')}
          alt="Steel pipes in the supply yard"
          class="split__img--tall"
          widths={[400, 740]}
          sizes="(min-width: 960px) 50vw, 100vw"
        />
        <div class="split__badge">
          <b>77+</b>
          <span>projects of various sizes completed for private and public sectors worldwide.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid--3">
        <Feature icon="trophy" title="Projects">
          The PETIC GLOBAL philosophy can be put into one simple formula: can do! That is a promise we have
          been fulfilling over and over, and it will remain the highest factor guiding our actions in future.
          We continually strive to improve our performance.
        </Feature>
        <Feature icon="target" title="Mission" delay={1}>
          Oil rigs or refineries, power stations or steel mills, piping, mechanical, construction: whatever
          the project, we can develop our involvement in those areas which allow our clients to take a back
          seat. Why? Because they know that everything which is or could be important is in good hands.
        </Feature>
        <Feature icon="eye" title="Think" delay={2}>
          Only if you plan with a good degree of foresight can serious mistakes be avoided. Foresight is a
          given at PETIC GLOBAL.
        </Feature>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--navy">
    <div class="container split">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our journey</span>
        <h2>From infrastructure to manufacturing.</h2>
        <p>
          The rapid growth of the group is driven by its bold vision, strong entrepreneurial spirit and
          devotion to customer satisfaction, delivering excellent quality products and services.
        </p>
        <ul class="timeline mt-lg">
          <li class="reveal">
            <span class="tag">Phase one</span>
            <h3>Gulf States &amp; Tanzania</h3>
            <p>
              Heavy investment in infrastructure and road projects, backed by a substantial fleet of mobile
              plant in the Gulf States and East Africa.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="reveal" data-delay="1">
            <span class="tag">Phase two</span>
            <h3>Rwanda &amp; Uganda</h3>
            <p>
              Manufacturing of household and pharmaceutical products in Rwanda, and gas cylinders in Uganda.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="reveal" data-delay="2">
            <span class="tag">Next</span>
            <h3>Automotive assembly in Africa</h3>
            <p>Representing Chinese car manufacturers by creating an assembling workshop in Africa.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal" data-delay="1">
        <div class="side-card side-card--glass">
          <span class="eyebrow">East Africa</span>
          <h3>East Trading &amp; Manufacturing Company LTD</h3>
          <p class="text-gold">{site.tanzaniaAddress}</p>
          <p>
            East Trading &amp; Manufacturing Company has been set up in Tanzania to provide quality
            construction services to real estate contractors, construction companies, and the civil
            engineering and infrastructure industries. The company established a successful track record
            through commitments to its customers within the operations and construction domain.
          </p>
          <p>
            After gaining extensive experience in building services, the company is moving forward to
            undertake complex and challenging civil engineering and building projects, extending its services
            from innovative technical concepts and front-end engineering designs to construction management,
            installation, commissioning and long-term operation and maintenance.
          </p>
          <p>
            The company holds a portfolio of strategic investments in the construction sector, owning a
            substantial fleet of mobile plant in the Gulf States and East Africa. This complements the
            company’s multi-domestic growth strategy, which focuses its operating hubs in both regions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split split--rev">
      <div class="split__media reveal">
        <Image
          src={img('oil-maintenance-crew.jpg')}
          alt="Maintenance crew servicing plant equipment"
          widths={[400, 790]}
          sizes="(min-width: 960px) 50vw, 100vw"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="reveal" data-delay="1">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our mission</span>
        <h2>Contributing to the development of the Gulf States and East Africa.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Our mission is to participate in and contribute to the development and enrichment of services in the
          Gulf States and East Africa region, offering communities solutions in the construction sector and
          providing high quality engineering services.
        </p>
        <p>
          The company is fully committed to looking after the interests of its customers, employees,
          shareholders and communities. The group conducts its business ethically and profitably as a
          responsible corporate citizen. To accomplish our mission, we continually:
        </p>
        <ul class="checks">
          <li>
            <Icon name="check" />
            <span>
              Enhance our competence with powerful, qualified engineering minds, enabling good communication
              at all levels to improve the operating environment.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <Icon name="check" />
            <span>
              Expand our presence in existing markets through fair pricing, respecting deadlines, quality
              products and good-value solutions, using advanced and creative technological approaches with
              continuous improvement of our operating systems.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <Icon name="check" />
            <span>
              Energize our employees by continuously promoting a culture that recognizes performance and
              valuable contributions, and celebrates successes.
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head section-head--center reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our licences</span>
        <h2>Registered, certified and accountable.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Certificates of incorporation, registrations and memberships held by the group’s companies in East
          Africa.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery reveal">
        {licences.map((l) => (
          <figure>
            <Image
              src={img(l.file)}
              alt={l.alt}
              class="gallery__doc"
              widths={[400, 800]}
              sizes="(min-width: 760px) 25vw, 50vw"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <figcaption>{l.caption}</figcaption>
          </figure>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Partners title="Trusted by global brands." />
  <Cta />
</Base>
